pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "#FFFFFF"
notes: |
  第五部分进入严谨的理论复杂度推导。
  许多稀疏算法虽然提出了稀疏拓扑，但由于路由开销本身过大，导致整体复杂度并未真正降阶。
  由式 6.1 可见，DLR-Attn 的总计算量严格由三部分构成：降维投影、路由搜索以及局部精确注意力。
  通过对分块簇数 B 求偏导并令其为零（式 6.2），我们解析求解出了最优分块阶数 B^* 严格与根号 N 成正比。
  将最优 B^* 代回总算力模型，最终严密证明了在维持全局感知的前提下，总计算复杂度可从 O(N^2) 严格压降至 O(N^1.5)。
elements:
  # Header Kicker
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [50, 30, 600, 16]
    content:
      fontSize: 10
      bold: true
      color: "$primary"
      letterSpacing: 1.2
      text: 05 · THEORETICAL COMPLEXITY DERIVATION

  # Header Title
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [50, 48, 860, 36]
    content:
      fontSize: 17
      bold: true
      color: "$fg"
      text: 理论证明：最优分块阶数 \( B^* = \Theta(\sqrt{N}) \) 下计算复杂度降至 \( O(N^{1.5}) \)
  # Top dividing line
  - elementId: div-top
    elementType: shape
    shapeName: rect
    bounds: [50, 86, 860, 1]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$ruleColor"
  - elementId: deriv-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [50, 98, 440, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      bold: true
      color: "$primary"
      text: 整体算力成本目标函数与最优化解析推导 (Proof of Theorem 1)

  # Equation array using split (compiles to <m:eqArr>)
  - elementId: formula-split
    elementType: text
    bounds: [50, 118, 440, 95]
    content:
      fontSize: 13
      align: [center, middle]
      text: |
        <p>\( \begin{split} C_{\mathrm{total}}(N, B) &= C_{\mathrm{proj}} + C_{\mathrm{router}} + C_{\mathrm{attn}} \\ &= N \cdot m + N \cdot B \cdot m + N \cdot \left( \frac{k N}{B} \right) \cdot d_k \end{split} \)</p>

  - elementId: num-61
    elementType: text
    bounds: [340, 214, 150, 18]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      bold: true
      color: "$gray"
      align: [right, middle]
      text: (式 6.1)

  # Derivative and stationary point
  - elementId: formula-stationary
    elementType: text
    bounds: [50, 236, 440, 80]
    content:
      fontSize: 13
      align: [center, middle]
      text: |
        <p>\( \frac{\partial C_{\mathrm{total}}}{\partial B} = N \cdot m - \frac{k N^2 d_k}{B^2} = 0 \Rightarrow B^* = \sqrt{\frac{k \cdot d_k}{m} \cdot N} \)</p>

  - elementId: num-62
    elementType: text
    bounds: [340, 318, 150, 18]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      bold: true
      color: "$gray"
      align: [right, middle]
      text: (式 6.2)

  # Optimal complexity with nth-root and product
  - elementId: formula-optimal
    elementType: text
    bounds: [50, 340, 440, 80]
    content:
      fontSize: 13
      align: [center, middle]
      text: |
        <p>\( C_{\mathrm{optimal}}(N) = 2 N \sqrt{k \cdot m \cdot d_k \cdot N} + N \cdot m = O\left( N \sqrt{N} \right) \)</p>

  - elementId: num-63
    elementType: text
    bounds: [340, 422, 150, 18]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      bold: true
      color: "$gray"
      align: [right, middle]
      text: (式 6.3)

  - elementId: deriv-notes
    elementType: text
    bounds: [50, 444, 440, 44]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      lineHeight: 1.4
      color: "$gray"
      text: |
        <p><strong>定理 1 结论：</strong>当分块簇数选取满足 \( B^* = \Theta(\sqrt{N}) \) 时，整体动态注意力在保证全局候选块全向可达性的前提下，实现 \( O(N^{1.5}) \) 紧确渐近复杂度，彻底突破二次方屏障。</p>

  # Right Column: Matplotlib Complexity Scaling Chart
  - elementId: comp-chart-img
    elementType: image
    bounds: [535, 102, 375, 230]
    src: assets/complexity_curves.png
    fit:
      mode: contain

  - elementId: comp-chart-caption
    elementType: text
    bounds: [535, 336, 375, 42]
    content:
      fontSize: 9.5
      lineHeight: 1.3
      color: "$gray"
      text: |
        <p><strong>图 6.1: 序列长度对归一化计算量（FLOPs）的缩放曲线对比</strong>。在 \( N \ge 4\mathrm{K} \) 区域，DLR-Attn 展现出优于 \( O(N^2) \) 的阶数级算力节约。</p>

  - elementId: comp-callout
    elementType: shape
    shapeName: rect
    bounds: [535, 386, 375, 92]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$lightGray"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: "$ruleColor"

  - elementId: comp-callout-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [550, 396, 345, 72]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      lineHeight: 1.35
      color: "$fg"
      text: |
        <p><span style="color:#009682; font-weight:bold;">● 交叉点分析（Crossover Point）：</span>在硬件实测中，由于降维投影引入常数项，临界交叉长度为 \( N \approx 2048 \)。当 \( N > 4096 \) 后，算法级降阶收益完全覆盖路由开销。</p>

  # Footer dividing line
  - elementId: div-bottom
    elementType: shape
    shapeName: rect
    bounds: [50, 498, 860, 1]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$ruleColor"
  - elementId: footer-nav
    elementType: text
    bounds: [50, 506, 860, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 10
      color: "$gray"
      text: |
        <p>面向长上下文推理的稀疏注意力机制 · 博士学位论文答辩 <span style="float:right;">§5 理论推导 ｜ 06 / 10</span></p>
